{% comment %}
  Emits the shop's money format once, for scripts that have to format a price
  the shopper just changed - a bundle total, a quantity subtotal - where Liquid
  cannot know the answer in advance.

  Prices that are known at render time must still go through the money filter.
  This is only for totals that move.
{% endcomment %}

<script>
  window.gharMoneyFormat = window.gharMoneyFormat || {{ shop.money_format | json }};
</script>
